    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels selfish to keep dragging them through this. like, by staying, i'm just making them miss out on a normal life. sometimes i look at them and i just think... if i wasn't here, they could finally just breathe. they wouldn't have to spend every weekend at doctors or worrying about if i'm okay. it almost feels like the kindest thing to do would be to just stop being a burden.",
